value="0..1 pencatat" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="tk-cm1-sah-per2"><mxGeometry x="1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm1-pcb-per" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#444444;fontSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="tk-cm1-pcb" target="tk-cm1-per"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1320" y="270"/><mxPoint x="1320" y="1160"/><mxPoint x="660" y="1160"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm1-pcb-per-l0" value="*" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="tk-cm1-pcb-per"><mxGeometry x="-1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm1-pcb-per-l1" value="1 pencabut" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="tk-cm1-pcb-per"><mxGeometry x="1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm1-jab-per" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#444444;fontSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.3;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="tk-cm1-jab" target="tk-cm1-per"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1120" y="1060"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm1-jab-per-l0" value="*" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="tk-cm1-jab-per"><mxGeometry x="-1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm1-jab-per-l1" value="* /pemegang_aktif" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="tk-cm1-jab-per"><mxGeometry x="1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm1-n1" value="&lt;b&gt;Notasi&lt;/b&gt; (Wazlawick 2024, Bab 8–9)&lt;br&gt;• Hanya konsep, atribut primitif, dan asosiasi: &lt;b&gt;tanpa method, tanpa detail Odoo&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• Garis polos = asosiasi; label di ujung = &lt;i&gt;peran&lt;/i&gt; dan multiplisitas. Belah ketupat hitam = komposisi (bagian–keseluruhan).&lt;br&gt;• Segitiga kosong ungu = generalisasi. Nama miring = konsep abstrak.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;/nama&lt;/code&gt; = atribut/asosiasi turunan (dihitung). «unique» = nilai tidak boleh kembar. &lt;code&gt;[*]&lt;/code&gt; = banyak nilai.&lt;br&gt;• Kotak abu-abu putus-putus = konsep yang dirinci di halaman lain." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1220" width="640" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm1-n2" value="&lt;b&gt;Kenapa riwayat pengesahan menjadi konsep?&lt;/b&gt; (Wazlawick §9.3.2) Dokumen &lt;i&gt;mendapat&lt;/i&gt; data baru saat statusnya berubah (tanggal sah, pengesah, berkas TTD, alasan pengembalian). Daripada atribut opsional yang membuat kelas tidak kohesif, setiap kejadian dimodelkan sebagai konsep. Satu dokumen bisa diajukan, dikembalikan, dan diajukan lagi, jadi &lt;b&gt;Pengajuan&lt;/b&gt; disimpan sebagai riwayat {ordered} (pola &lt;i&gt;history&lt;/i&gt;, §11.12.2).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;revisi_dari / pengganti&lt;/b&gt; = pola &lt;i&gt;superseding&lt;/i&gt; (§11.9.2): dokumen baru menggantikan yang lama tanpa menghapusnya." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="1220" width="640" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm1-n3" value="&lt;b&gt;Invarian&lt;/b&gt; (dari aturan bisnis):&lt;br&gt;• status = disahkan ⇒ pengajuan terakhir punya Pengesahan (AB-03)&lt;br&gt;• Pengesahan.jabatan_pengesah punya wewenang &lt;i&gt;mengesahkan&lt;/i&gt; untuk /jenis (AB-02)&lt;br&gt;• Pengembalian, Penarikan, Pencabutan: alasan ≠ kosong (AB-05)&lt;br&gt;• pencatat terisi hanya bila dicatat atas nama orang lain [KONFIRMASI]" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1360" y="1220" width="330" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm1-n4" value="Bahan kerja (tidak masuk proposal). Sumber: expanded use case, kamus DTO SSD. Rincian: rancangan/conceptual-model-tata-kelola.md · Draf 13 Nov 2026 · Febriyan" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1380" width="1300" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="tk-cm2" name="CM-2 Struktur Organisasi dan Pengendalian Dokumen"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1820" pageHeight="1470" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="tk-cm2-title" value="CM-2 · Conceptual model: struktur organisasi (PKG-03) dan pengendalian dokumen (PKG-02)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="