y></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm2-sos-per-l0" value="*" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="tk-cm2-sos-per"><mxGeometry x="-1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm2-sos-per-l1" value="1..* peserta" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="tk-cm2-sos-per"><mxGeometry x="1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm2-tnj-per" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#444444;fontSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.9;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="tk-cm2-tnj" target="tk-cm2-per"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1250" y="1170"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm2-tnj-per-l0" value="*" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="tk-cm2-tnj-per"><mxGeometry x="-1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm2-tnj-per-l1" value="1 peninjau" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="tk-cm2-tnj-per"><mxGeometry x="1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm2-n1" value="&lt;b&gt;Notasi&lt;/b&gt; (Wazlawick 2024, Bab 8–9)&lt;br&gt;• Hanya konsep, atribut primitif, dan asosiasi: &lt;b&gt;tanpa method, tanpa detail Odoo&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• Garis polos = asosiasi; label di ujung = &lt;i&gt;peran&lt;/i&gt; dan multiplisitas. Belah ketupat hitam = komposisi (bagian–keseluruhan).&lt;br&gt;• Segitiga kosong ungu = generalisasi. Nama miring = konsep abstrak.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;/nama&lt;/code&gt; = atribut/asosiasi turunan (dihitung). «unique» = nilai tidak boleh kembar. &lt;code&gt;[*]&lt;/code&gt; = banyak nilai.&lt;br&gt;• Kotak abu-abu putus-putus = konsep yang dirinci di halaman lain." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1260" width="640" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm2-n2" value="&lt;b&gt;Pola analisis&lt;/b&gt; (Wazlawick Bab 11)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;i&gt;Organizational hierarchy&lt;/i&gt; (§11.8): Jabatan–atasan; ditambah pengganti dan koordinasi.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;i&gt;Effectivity&lt;/i&gt; (§11.12.1): Penetapan dan SKPenetapan berperiode; &lt;code&gt;/pemegang_aktif&lt;/code&gt; = personel pada Penetapan dari SK berstatus disahkan yang periodenya mencakup hari ini (asosiasi turunan dengan filter, §8.4.4).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;i&gt;History&lt;/i&gt; (§11.12.2): versi {ordered}, tinjau ulang {ordered}.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;/versi_berlaku&lt;/code&gt; = versi dengan status disahkan (AB-04: paling banyak satu)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="1260" width="600" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm2-n3" value="&lt;b&gt;Enumerasi lain&lt;/b&gt;: JenisPersonel {dosen, laboran_plp, teknisi, asisten, petugas_k3, eksternal}; KategoriDokumen {tata_tertib, praktikum, operasi, k3, alat, peminjaman, kedaruratan, limbah}; AlasanRevisi {tinjauan_berkala, perubahan_alat, perubahan_metode, perubahan_fasilitas, perubahan_risiko, perubahan_lingkup}.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;[KONFIRMASI]&lt;/b&gt; konsep Personel bersama kelompok." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1320" y="1260" width="440" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm2-n4" value="Bahan kerja (tidak masuk proposal). Sumber: expanded use case, kamus DTO SSD. Rincian: rancangan/conceptual-model-tata-kelola.md · Draf 13 Nov 2026 · Febriyan" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1410" width="1300" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="tk-cm3" name="CM-3 Perencanaan"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1800" pageHeight="1540" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="tk-cm3-title" value="CM-3 · Conceptual model: perencanaan (PKG-01, PKG-13)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1500" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm3-sas" value="&lt;b&gt;SasaranStrategis&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=27;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="60" width="240" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-cm3-sas-a" value="+ kode: String&lt;br&gt;+ sasaran: Text&lt;br&gt;+ target_akhir: String" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex=